// No dream while the main character is a statue or imprisoned (lua/M_CBMP1.lua keeps the global).
// An empty RESPONSE stops CAIScript::Find before later dream blocks (keeping their variables unset
// for the first rest after he is free) while leaving m_actionList empty so CInfGame::RestParty still
// rests the party; even NoAction() counts as a dream action and aborts resting.
IF
  Global("CBM_P1_OUT","GLOBAL",1)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
END
